@baseUrl = http://localhost:5085

### Discover the API
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### List seeded products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
X-Correlation-ID: atlas-learning-run

### Find the seeded product
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/d85b1407-351d-4694-9392-03acc5870eb1

### Create a product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "USB-C dock",
  "price": 129.50
}

### Observe validation problem details
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": 0
}

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
